@Contactly_HostAddress = http://localhost:5148

### List contacts
GET {{Contactly_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

### Create a contact
POST {{Contactly_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jordan Lee",
  "email": "jordan@example.com",
  "phone": "+1 555 0100",
  "favorite": true
}

###
